# Effect style

Full rule: [`docs/standards/effect-style.md`](../../docs/standards/effect-style.md).

- Prefer `effect` / `effect/unstable/*` over external packages that duplicate them.
- Use Effect platform/node services (`FileSystem`, `Path`, `ChildProcess`, `NodeServices`, …)
  — not raw `node:*` — in new Effect code.
- If no Effect service exists for a primitive, isolate the Node API behind a small
  Effect-returning helper (see `dev/cli/run.ts` / `scripts/mark-the-surface-check.ts`).
- Errors that cross the wire are schema / `Data.TaggedError` values — never extend native `Error`.
- Read the pinned Effect source (`node_modules/effect/src/…`) before guessing APIs.
